# T-974: Unit constructor desugar-pass injection (consolidated from B-296 eval-dict pre-scan)
# Unit constructors from [type ...] declarations are injected by the desugar pass.
# The variant tag is qualified as "TypeName.CtorName" for keyed type declarations.
[
  Transport: [type Tcp Udp]
  tcp-val: Tcp
  udp-val: Udp
]
=== out
Dict({"Tcp": Variant(Transport.Tcp, Null), "Udp": Variant(Transport.Udp, Null), "tcp-val": Variant(Transport.Tcp, Null), "udp-val": Variant(Transport.Udp, Null)})
